        "urpx:selfContained": true,
        "urpx:explainedBy": {
          "@type": "urpx:Evaluation",
          "@id": "cpau:cc-e-eec-1-2026-07-01-evaluation",
          "urpx:evaluationKind": {
            "@id": "urpx:coverageEvaluation"
          },
          "urpx:description": "This filing does not carry everything its source document states. 1 parts are deferred, listed here in the same words as the filing's tariff.toml [modeling].deferrals so the two records cannot drift. (1) Section A bars concurrent time-of-use service (\"This Rate Schedule may not apply in conjunction with any time-of-use Rate Schedule\"). The model carries this only as urpx:description prose; its eligibility rule tests customer kind, NEM status and metering, and carries no time-of-use predicate. The NEM test in the same file shows the exclusion shape is expressible.",
